#           Logic identical to index.js (ESM source, `export default function typeDetect`).
# Verified by execution on Node v24.16.0 (real package required and called on
#   ~50 representative values; every return string in this SIR was observed, not
#   recalled). Notably CORRECTED vs the task hint: a bigint primitive returns the
#   LOWERCASE 'bigint' (typeof), NOT 'BigInt'; 'BigInt' is only the result for a
#   BOXED bigint object Object(10n) (which is OUT for the codec).
